<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[Project-domain run (model_domain=PROJECT) on three links in Washtenaw County: link 1 on road type 4 (1 mile, 1000 veh/h, 30 mph), link 2 on road type 5 (0.5 mile, 600 veh/h, 25 mph) and off-network link 3 on road type 1, for two source types (21, 32) and four processes (running, start, brake wear, tire wear). ProjectTAG's SHO on two links and its Starts from offNetworkLink; LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator on two speeds. Snapshot capture supplies the project DB from county-inputs/washtenaw-project-links/setup-project-links.sql.]]></description>
